WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:39.121
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:39.391 --> 01:42.080
[Episode 23]

3
01:42.080 --> 01:44.220
[Yu's Mansion]

4
01:46.959 --> 01:48.806
What are you doing?

5
01:50.720 --> 01:52.227
Was this your doing?

6
01:55.560 --> 01:56.846
What?

7
01:57.800 --> 02:02.859
Are you going to fight your own father over some half-dead woman?

8
02:03.520 --> 02:05.460
I didn't expect this either.

9
02:05.460 --> 02:07.640
You may be the Commander-in-Chief of an army,

10
02:07.640 --> 02:13.137
never thought you'd stoop this low to a helpless woman on her sickbed.

11
02:13.137 --> 02:19.613
Anyone who tries to ruin my son will die a dog's death.

12
02:24.019 --> 02:25.519
Commander-in-Chief Yu.

13
02:26.120 --> 02:27.686
Then listen carefully.

14
02:28.880 --> 02:35.140
If anything happens to Ye Ping Jun, I swear you'll lose your son.

15
02:36.720 --> 02:38.084
How dare you!

16
02:38.084 --> 02:41.040
Ye Ping Jun is my lawful wife.

17
02:41.040 --> 02:45.139
If she is hurt in any way, I'll go through it with her.

18
02:46.859 --> 02:50.780
If you want her life, you'll have to take mine first.

19
02:53.079 --> 02:54.380
Chang Xuan!

20
03:01.519 --> 03:03.040
What are you doing?

21
03:03.040 --> 03:05.380
- Can't we talk this through? - Let go.

22
03:05.380 --> 03:08.280
Stop waving weapons around.

23
03:08.280 --> 03:09.440
Take this.

24
03:10.720 --> 03:11.859
Father.

25
03:12.639 --> 03:16.033
Listen carefully. I'm not my brother.

26
03:18.480 --> 03:22.020
I control my own life.

27
03:29.380 --> 03:31.040
Zhong Quan.

28
03:31.040 --> 03:34.019
Don't you see it?

29
03:34.019 --> 03:38.233
He's willing to die for the girl he loves.

30
03:39.335 --> 03:42.540
Can't you let him have his way?

31
03:42.540 --> 03:44.179
Bao Ru.

32
03:44.179 --> 03:46.940
He's lost his mind. Don't lose yours with him.

33
03:46.940 --> 03:49.169
Don't you understand what's at stake?

34
03:49.169 --> 03:53.120
If he marries Ye Ping Jun, his life will be ruined.

35
03:53.120 --> 03:57.284
Our family will be ruined too.

36
03:57.284 --> 03:59.280
But we already got it wrong once.

37
03:59.280 --> 04:01.660
Are we going to keep getting it wrong?

38
04:03.559 --> 04:05.033
What did we do wrong?

39
04:06.880 --> 04:10.079
All these years, I've often wondered...

40
04:10.079 --> 04:14.840
if we hadn't forced Ming Xuan to take over the Yu Army,

41
04:14.840 --> 04:18.379
if we had let him follow his own dreams,

42
04:18.379 --> 04:22.320
if we hadn't forced him to marry someone he didn't love,

43
04:22.320 --> 04:27.613
maybe then he wouldn't have died on the battlefield.

44
04:29.600 --> 04:35.379
Maybe he could never be the son you wanted.

45
04:35.379 --> 04:39.360
But at least he'd still be here with us.

46
04:39.360 --> 04:46.066
As his parents, aren't we the ones most responsible for Ming Xuan's death?

47
04:48.939 --> 04:50.739
I'm doing this for his own good.

48
04:50.739 --> 04:53.240
I'm doing this so he can take over the Yu Army smoothly.

49
04:53.240 --> 04:55.600
For his own good?

50
04:55.600 --> 04:58.460
But is that what he truly wants?

51
04:59.799 --> 05:01.179
Don't forget.

52
05:01.179 --> 05:03.900
You're not just the Commander-in-Chief of the Yu Army.

53
05:03.900 --> 05:06.679
You're also their father.

54
05:06.679 --> 05:09.739
I don't want this tragedy to happen again.

55
05:10.780 --> 05:13.179
Let him be, just this once.

56
05:13.179 --> 05:17.319
Let him choose for himself, all right?

57
05:35.680 --> 05:38.560
[Marriage Certificate, Forever United in Love]

58
06:00.680 --> 06:04.200
[Witness: Yu Chang Xuan]

59
06:44.880 --> 06:46.153
Ping Jun.

60
06:49.259 --> 06:50.799
We're married.

61
06:52.600 --> 06:56.580
From today on, I'm your husband.

62
06:57.600 --> 06:59.540
You're my wife.

63
07:01.080 --> 07:06.020
I, Yu Chang Xuan, will never let you down.

64
07:21.608 --> 07:24.940
[Marriage Certificate, Forever United in Love]

65
07:26.920 --> 07:31.800
[Spring]

66
07:44.880 --> 07:48.040
There are many new flowers in the courtyard at Maple Mansion.

67
07:48.040 --> 07:53.846
Peonies, roses, and your favorite plantain lilies.

68
07:55.340 --> 07:59.259
When you wake up, I'll make them into your favorite sachets.

69
08:03.320 --> 08:06.853
[Summer]

70
08:32.200 --> 08:35.960
Today, I suddenly remembered a line of verse from a poem I memorized as a child.

71
08:37.520 --> 08:39.920
"Just as I got the lamp lit,

72
08:41.039 --> 08:44.600
rain beat the pear blossoms, behind closed doors."

73
08:46.460 --> 08:48.253
You probably memorized it too, right?

74
09:08.720 --> 09:10.373
The Deputy Commander has arrived.

75
09:15.499 --> 09:16.800
Have a seat.

76
09:41.280 --> 09:45.193
[Autumn]

77
10:33.320 --> 10:34.960
Master Jin, join me for a round.

78
10:52.800 --> 10:54.653
Director Liang, you have a letter.

79
10:59.499 --> 11:00.673
All right.

80
11:09.480 --> 11:11.606
[Please help arrange safe passage for three patriots.]

81
11:12.840 --> 11:15.353
[Winter]

82
11:17.320 --> 11:20.413
The snow hasn't let up since yesterday.

83
11:23.119 --> 11:25.779
This is our first New Year's Eve together.

84
11:26.760 --> 11:28.846
I made you fennel dumplings.

85
11:29.680 --> 11:31.946
I don't know if you'll like them.

86
11:34.640 --> 11:36.593
I'm still learning, so I'm not very good yet.

87
11:38.019 --> 11:39.366
Is that alright?

88
11:48.680 --> 11:51.220
[Maple Mansion]

89
12:19.539 --> 12:21.040
Let's eat.

90
12:46.800 --> 12:48.141
Wan Xuan.

91
12:48.920 --> 12:50.520
Qi Xuan.

92
12:50.520 --> 12:51.699
Eat.

93
13:12.360 --> 13:14.639
[Two years later]

94
13:14.639 --> 13:16.019
Extra!

95
13:16.019 --> 13:18.320
Cheng Jun bribed his way into the presidency.

96
13:18.320 --> 13:20.379
He was impeached and forced out.

97
13:22.119 --> 13:23.539
Extra!

98
13:23.539 --> 13:25.779
Cheng Jun bribed his way into the presidency.

99
13:25.779 --> 13:27.999
He was impeached and forced out.

100
13:27.999 --> 13:29.899
Extra!

101
13:29.899 --> 13:31.379
Extra!

102
13:31.379 --> 13:33.340
Cheng Jun bribed his way into the presidency.

103
13:33.340 --> 13:35.120
He was impeached and forced out.

104
13:35.120 --> 13:36.313
Kill!

105
13:37.240 --> 13:38.739
Commander.

106
13:38.739 --> 13:42.300
Chang Xuan foresaw this two years ago.

107
13:42.300 --> 13:47.200
He stood his ground and refused to put our Yu Army under Cheng Jun.

108
13:47.200 --> 13:52.320
Otherwise we'd be in a bind today, just like Chu Wen Fu.

109
13:54.120 --> 13:56.060
Yi Gang.

110
13:56.060 --> 13:57.899
We've been friends for years.

111
13:57.899 --> 14:00.120
I won't hide anything from you.

112
14:00.120 --> 14:05.940
I respect Chang Xuan's judgment and his wisdom.

113
14:05.940 --> 14:07.960
He is Deputy Commander now.

114
14:07.960 --> 14:13.720
He will take the helm of the Yu Army.

115
14:13.720 --> 14:17.779
He'll need the support of veterans like you.

116
14:18.920 --> 14:22.720
As long as Chang Xuan doesn't mind us old-timers being behind the times,

117
14:22.720 --> 14:25.399
we'll follow his lead.

118
14:26.200 --> 14:29.040
Over the years, Rui Tong has helped Chang Xuan a lot.

119
14:29.859 --> 14:34.680
Your son will be Chang Xuan's right-hand man.

120
14:35.300 --> 14:37.460
Rui Tong doesn't even compare.

121
14:37.460 --> 14:39.619
Bing Wen has an outstanding war record.

122
14:39.619 --> 14:42.480
He is your son-in-law and Chang Xuan's brother-in-law.

123
14:42.480 --> 14:47.060
They are all family to me. I don't play favorites.

124
14:48.859 --> 14:50.300
Thank you.

125
14:52.499 --> 14:55.460
But with Cheng Jun out of power,

126
14:55.460 --> 14:58.100
Chu Wen Fu's influence will weaken again.

127
14:58.100 --> 15:02.920
I'm afraid that Mou Lin Sen will reach out to him now.

128
15:02.920 --> 15:07.039
If those two join forces, we'll be attacked from both sides.

129
15:09.019 --> 15:13.760
That's exactly what worries me.

130
15:13.760 --> 15:17.197
Chang Xuan is at the helm of the Yu Army.

131
15:17.197 --> 15:20.977
The men he's up against are cunning veterans.

132
15:22.000 --> 15:24.780
There is no guarantee he can win.

133
15:30.120 --> 15:35.406
Governor Chu, I'm honored by your hospitality.

134
15:38.460 --> 15:43.499
This is our first meal alone together in all these years.

135
15:45.039 --> 15:46.760
Try the lamb here.

136
15:46.760 --> 15:48.693
It's fresh, with none of that gamey smell.

137
15:50.239 --> 15:55.560
I brought a few peanuts to liven up the meal.

138
15:59.560 --> 16:03.200
Yu Chang Xuan went to the German consulate today.

139
16:03.200 --> 16:05.259
He went to discuss buying the steel mill.

140
16:06.560 --> 16:10.760
He wants to take his arms production further.

141
16:12.200 --> 16:13.859
The situation is clear.

142
16:13.859 --> 16:16.200
No need for us to beat around the bush.

143
16:17.280 --> 16:18.460
Governor.

144
16:20.040 --> 16:26.040
I hope our two sides can sit at the same table from now on.

145
16:26.759 --> 16:28.739
I hope we can share the same pot.

146
16:33.840 --> 16:36.200
Cooperation is built on trust.

147
16:39.640 --> 16:41.746
Cooperation is built on mutual interest.

148
16:43.200 --> 16:45.933
The Sandao River gold mine. You take sixty, I take forty.

149
16:47.039 --> 16:52.680
Your men take over Pingsui Railway tariffs and merchant protection.

150
16:55.859 --> 16:56.899
Here.

151
17:03.440 --> 17:05.400
Now Cheng Jun has stepped down.

152
17:05.400 --> 17:10.180
His northern air force moved its remaining planes to the Tianjin concession.

153
17:10.180 --> 17:11.339
Last night,

154
17:11.339 --> 17:15.449
with the newly deployed antiaircraft guns and favorable terrain,

155
17:15.449 --> 17:18.942
Wu Zuo Xiao intercepted three planes and forced them to land.

156
17:18.942 --> 17:24.183
We seized the planes, unmounted bombs, and maintenance equipment onboard.

157
17:24.183 --> 17:28.676
We also seized the secret agreement between Cheng Jun and the Italian arms dealer.

158
17:28.676 --> 17:32.800
Next, Nanhuai Arsenal will work with senior technicians.

159
17:32.800 --> 17:35.400
Together, we will dismantle Fiat bombers' liquid-cooled engines.

160
17:35.400 --> 17:38.723
We will modify them into a model better suited to extreme cold.

161
17:38.723 --> 17:43.520
Then, from the arsenal's Liao Type 13 rifle, we'll make an aircraft-mounted machine gun.

162
17:43.520 --> 17:45.466
That will solve our lack of aerial firepower.

163
17:46.200 --> 17:47.341
- Yes, sir. - Yes, sir.

164
18:45.960 --> 18:48.039
Lady Ping Jun is awake.

165
18:48.039 --> 18:49.839
Lady Ping Jun is awake.

166
18:49.839 --> 18:51.999
Lady Ping Jun is awake.

167
18:51.999 --> 18:53.646
Lady Ping Jun is awake.

168
19:04.259 --> 19:05.380
Chang Xuan.

169
19:06.320 --> 19:09.604
We have found a lead on the arms dealer who sold faulty weapons.

170
19:09.604 --> 19:11.420
We confirmed he fled to the Heihe border.

171
19:11.420 --> 19:13.280
We should be able to catch him soon.

172
19:13.280 --> 19:16.926
He's been in deep hiding for over two years.

173
19:18.360 --> 19:20.360
Now that he's resurfaced...

174
19:20.360 --> 19:21.539
We will take him alive.

175
19:22.460 --> 19:23.759
Good.

176
19:25.059 --> 19:26.606
We've got Headquarters covered.

177
19:26.606 --> 19:28.873
Go home and take care of your wife.

178
19:30.579 --> 19:34.259
Thank you for carrying so much of my burden during this time.

179
19:41.253 --> 19:43.260
Hello, Nanhuai Army Headquarters.

180
19:44.280 --> 19:45.520
Master Chang Xuan.

181
19:52.106 --> 19:53.999
- Go ahead. - Master Chang Xuan, this is Xiao Tang.

182
19:53.999 --> 19:55.733
Lady Ping Jun is awake.

183
20:41.620 --> 20:43.759
I've made myself very clear.

184
20:43.759 --> 20:46.720
Deputy Commander Yu, please leave me alone.

185
20:46.720 --> 20:48.620
What if I insist on having my way?

186
20:51.900 --> 20:57.180
Do you want a repeat of what happened at the Maple Mansion?

187
21:19.880 --> 21:22.173
Master Chang Xuan is probably back.

188
21:26.819 --> 21:28.239
Master Chang Xuan.

189
21:28.239 --> 21:29.380
Master Chang Xuan.

190
21:36.840 --> 21:38.140
You're awake.

191
21:38.900 --> 21:40.739
Who are you?

192
21:49.740 --> 21:52.920
Master Chang Xuan. Lady Ping Jun has been like this since she woke up.

193
21:52.920 --> 21:55.781
She seems to have forgotten everything.

194
22:09.140 --> 22:10.380
Ping Jun.

195
22:11.280 --> 22:12.800
You don't remember me?

196
22:18.399 --> 22:19.920
Take a good look at me.

197
22:19.920 --> 22:21.380
I'm Yu Chang Xuan.

198
22:29.560 --> 22:31.560
Yu Chang Xuan?

199
22:33.040 --> 22:34.213
Ping Jun.

200
22:35.200 --> 22:36.819
Yu Chang Xuan?

201
22:38.080 --> 22:40.400
What's wrong, Ping Jun?

202
22:40.400 --> 22:41.640
Lady Ping Jun.

203
22:41.640 --> 22:44.039
Alright. Let's not think about it.

204
22:44.039 --> 22:45.440
Here.

205
22:45.440 --> 22:47.520
Let me help you lie down for a bit.

206
22:47.520 --> 22:49.610
Easy.

207
22:49.610 --> 22:51.290
Easy.

208
23:09.539 --> 23:11.440
How is she now?

209
23:11.440 --> 23:13.160
Master Chang Xuan.

210
23:13.160 --> 23:16.160
She inhaled too much smoke.

211
23:16.160 --> 23:20.406
Her brain was severely deprived of oxygen, causing a severe hematoma.

212
23:21.000 --> 23:22.760
That's what caused the memory loss.

213
23:30.826 --> 23:32.666
When will she recover?

214
23:34.080 --> 23:39.002
Surgery would be extremely risky. We can only wait for the hematoma to clear.

215
23:39.002 --> 23:41.900
She may start improving within a few months.

216
23:41.900 --> 23:46.899
Or she may never recover.

217
23:56.600 --> 23:58.541
Lady Ping Jun, you're awake.

218
24:01.520 --> 24:02.921
Careful.

219
24:11.259 --> 24:14.739
Lady Ping Jun, are you feeling better?

220
24:32.520 --> 24:34.680
Master Chang Xuan ordered us to put all these flowers here.

221
24:34.680 --> 24:38.461
He wants fresh ones in your bedroom every day.

222
24:41.019 --> 24:45.680
Who was that just now?

223
24:45.680 --> 24:47.539
That was Master Chang Xuan.

224
24:47.539 --> 24:48.839
He's your husband.

225
24:48.839 --> 24:51.893
He is the fearsome Deputy Commander of Nanhuai's Yu Army.

226
24:53.160 --> 24:54.273
My husband?

227
25:08.120 --> 25:13.721
Why can't I remember anything?

228
25:16.079 --> 25:18.720
When Master Chang Xuan brought you back from the hospital,

229
25:18.720 --> 25:24.093
he said you were hurt in the fire and had been unconscious for over two years.

230
25:27.220 --> 25:29.140
Over two years?

231
25:30.980 --> 25:33.819
The doctor said you might never wake up.

232
25:33.819 --> 25:35.779
But Master Chang Xuan insisted on marrying you.

233
25:35.779 --> 25:37.140
He even told his father

234
25:37.140 --> 25:40.980
that even if you never woke up, he would care for you for life.

235
25:42.239 --> 25:44.980
You have no idea how good he's been to you.

236
25:44.980 --> 25:48.200
For more than two years, he's stayed by your side to care for you.

237
25:48.200 --> 25:51.364
Massages, sponge baths, every day.

238
25:51.364 --> 25:53.880
With many of your medicines, he would not let the kitchen handle them.

239
25:53.880 --> 25:58.079
He brewed them himself and stayed to feed them to you.

240
26:02.559 --> 26:07.220
Look. He set up his bed beside yours so he could look after you.

241
26:18.880 --> 26:20.061
Master Chang Xuan.

242
26:20.720 --> 26:23.540
She inhaled too much smoke.

243
26:23.540 --> 26:28.081
Her brain was severely deprived of oxygen, causing a severe hematoma.

244
26:28.081 --> 26:29.753
That's what caused the memory loss.

245
26:34.840 --> 26:36.760
Master Chang Xuan.

246
26:36.760 --> 26:38.039
Master Chang Xuan.

247
26:38.039 --> 26:39.900
Lady Ping Jun would like to see you.

248
27:05.739 --> 27:07.480
You're my husband.

249
27:10.539 --> 27:11.739
Yes.

250
27:14.860 --> 27:17.440
Xiao Tang told me everything.

251
27:17.440 --> 27:21.000
You've been taking care of me all this time.

252
27:26.839 --> 27:29.339
But I don't remember anything.

253
27:29.339 --> 27:33.980
I don't know how I could ever repay you.

254
27:45.999 --> 27:49.980
We're husband and wife. You don't need to repay me.

255
27:51.520 --> 27:53.640
You woke up.

256
27:53.640 --> 27:56.133
That's the luckiest thing in the world to me.

257
27:58.880 --> 28:03.020
Then how did we meet?

258
28:04.600 --> 28:06.880
It's already a miracle she woke up.

259
28:06.880 --> 28:11.720
She must not be upset again, or it could be fatal.

260
28:13.259 --> 28:15.499
You were a student at Mingde Girls' School.

261
28:16.205 --> 28:20.165
After graduation, you became a copyist at Yuchun Opera House.

262
28:21.339 --> 28:25.960
When we first met, we were always bickering.

263
28:25.960 --> 28:27.960
But fate has a funny way of working.

264
28:28.760 --> 28:31.020
We went through a lot together.

265
28:33.960 --> 28:38.240
Little by little, we fell in love.

266
28:45.360 --> 28:48.013
What about my parents?

267
28:51.660 --> 28:55.853
Your father has another family.

268
28:57.160 --> 28:59.240
He wasn't there when you were growing up.

269
28:59.240 --> 29:03.284
He works in finance, and now does business in Southeast Asia.

270
29:03.284 --> 29:07.605
I've already sent him a letter, telling him you're awake.

271
29:09.079 --> 29:10.686
Your mother...

272
29:18.080 --> 29:19.619
My mother...

273
29:21.120 --> 29:22.521
What happened to her?

274
29:27.339 --> 29:30.220
Your mother had a lung disease for years.

275
29:30.220 --> 29:34.779
She had surgery, but her condition never improved.

276
29:36.539 --> 29:38.299
She passed away long ago.

277
29:50.019 --> 29:51.460
You still have me.

278
29:52.480 --> 29:54.233
I'll always be here with you.

279
30:13.480 --> 30:16.160
I know you can't remember anything right now.

280
30:17.039 --> 30:18.339
There's no rush.

281
30:19.279 --> 30:21.079
We have all the time in the world.

282
30:32.520 --> 30:34.079
It's not as hot now.

283
30:34.079 --> 30:35.380
Take your medicine first.

284
31:17.279 --> 31:19.339
I won.

285
31:19.339 --> 31:20.680
What is going on?

286
31:20.680 --> 31:27.383
- Big. - Big.

287
31:27.383 --> 31:31.840
- Big. - Big.

288
31:36.320 --> 31:38.320
You're my husband?

289
31:38.320 --> 31:39.320
Yes.

290
31:40.200 --> 31:42.746
What about my parents?

291
31:46.760 --> 31:50.361
Your father has another family.

292
31:51.559 --> 31:56.620
Your mother passed away long ago.

293
32:29.560 --> 32:31.459
Drinking won't help.

294
32:32.480 --> 32:36.861
You'll still have to face reality when you sober up.

295
32:40.319 --> 32:41.620
Jin.

296
32:45.440 --> 32:47.599
Did I really make a mistake?

297
32:49.400 --> 32:52.040
If I hadn't stopped her at the pier,

298
32:54.560 --> 32:57.000
would none of this have happened?

299
32:58.880 --> 33:00.539
It was just an accident.

300
33:02.400 --> 33:07.200
But now you're hiding this from Ping Jun.

301
33:08.680 --> 33:10.019
Have you thought this through?

302
33:14.640 --> 33:16.200
I have.

303
33:17.680 --> 33:19.646
I know I'm being selfish.

304
33:22.760 --> 33:25.401
I know what I'm doing is wrong.

305
33:26.839 --> 33:29.039
I know I shouldn't lie to her.

306
33:32.900 --> 33:35.460
But I just can't let go.

307
33:36.840 --> 33:41.281
What are you going to do next?

308
33:47.880 --> 33:50.599
I think this is a chance from God.

309
33:53.680 --> 33:55.821
We can forget everything.

310
33:58.760 --> 34:00.560
We can start over.

311
34:09.119 --> 34:11.226
Look at those gamblers downstairs.

312
34:12.800 --> 34:17.040
They always think that one big bet can turn their lives around.

313
34:17.040 --> 34:21.381
But life isn't as simple as a wager.

314
34:23.240 --> 34:24.999
Especially when feelings are involved.

315
34:25.600 --> 34:30.920
Once you gamble away that bond, there are no second chances.

316
34:34.320 --> 34:37.220
Big.

317
34:38.940 --> 34:40.980
- Big. - Big.

318
34:40.980 --> 34:44.219
- Open it. - Big.

319
34:47.360 --> 34:49.533
I won.

320
34:56.200 --> 34:58.286
I placed that bet myself,

321
35:00.520 --> 35:03.746
so I should face the consequences.

322
35:09.440 --> 35:17.309
♪ My words of love cannot reach you ♪

323
35:17.309 --> 35:24.213
♪ Don't... ♪

324
35:33.780 --> 35:36.880
Miss. Practicing this late?

325
35:36.880 --> 35:39.693
Master Chang Xuan is here. He's having drinks with Master Jin.

326
35:42.039 --> 35:46.400
It's been a whole year

327
35:46.400 --> 35:49.466
since he last came to hear me sing.

328
35:50.920 --> 35:53.520
Now that he's here,

329
35:53.520 --> 35:57.699
what does that have to do with me?

330
35:57.699 --> 36:01.340
Don't say that. Master Chang Xuan has a lot on his plate.

331
36:01.340 --> 36:04.313
Now that he's here, isn't that good news?

332
36:04.980 --> 36:06.420
Go back to bed.

333
36:06.420 --> 36:08.340
I'll be going to bed soon, too.

334
36:08.340 --> 36:09.639
Miss.

335
36:52.760 --> 36:54.139
Busy at work?

336
36:54.139 --> 36:56.059
You're coming home later and later.

337
36:56.059 --> 36:58.400
Many kids have had typhoid and coughs lately.

338
36:58.400 --> 37:00.659
The orphanage is short-staffed.

339
37:00.659 --> 37:03.133
It's so late. Why aren't you asleep?

340
37:05.840 --> 37:07.280
I was waiting for you.

341
37:09.619 --> 37:11.179
You don't have to wait for me anymore.

342
37:11.179 --> 37:13.372
I have to be at the clinic early tomorrow.

343
37:13.372 --> 37:14.800
You should get some rest, too.

344
37:15.632 --> 37:18.599
It's cold lately. I'll drive you tomorrow.

345
37:18.599 --> 37:20.880
That way, you can rest a little longer on the way.

346
37:20.880 --> 37:22.480
You really don't have to.

347
37:36.679 --> 37:39.280
You were a student at Mingde Girls' School.

348
37:39.280 --> 37:43.780
After graduation, you became a copyist at Yuchun Opera House.

349
37:43.780 --> 37:48.360
When we first met, we were always bickering.

350
37:48.360 --> 37:50.340
But fate has a funny way of working.

351
37:51.800 --> 37:55.800
Little by little, we fell in love.

352
38:03.360 --> 38:04.946
Still awake at this hour?

353
38:08.800 --> 38:12.146
What, have you forgotten who I am again?

354
38:13.760 --> 38:15.519
I haven't forgotten.

355
38:15.519 --> 38:17.280
You're Yu Chang Xuan.

356
38:24.280 --> 38:25.560
What else?

357
38:35.000 --> 38:37.287
There's something I want to tell you.

358
38:37.960 --> 38:39.259
Go ahead.

359
38:40.740 --> 38:43.480
I know we're husband and wife.

360
38:44.320 --> 38:48.079
And I'm truly grateful for how you've cared for me.

361
38:48.079 --> 38:49.900
But...

362
38:49.900 --> 38:52.940
But I really can't remember anything.

363
38:52.940 --> 38:58.920
Could you give me a little more time to get to know you again?

364
38:58.920 --> 39:02.420
Give me time to remember what we meant to each other.

365
39:02.420 --> 39:07.373
Then we can live together more naturally and peacefully.

366
39:16.400 --> 39:17.519
So?

367
39:19.499 --> 39:21.240
So...

368
39:22.820 --> 39:26.940
I really can't sleep in the same room as you.

369
39:26.940 --> 39:30.420
Could you sleep somewhere else?

370
39:48.440 --> 39:50.840
For over two years,

371
39:50.840 --> 39:55.480
I've slept in this room, on this cot.

372
39:56.920 --> 40:01.679
I stayed by your side all night, taking care of you.

373
40:06.600 --> 40:08.240
What?

374
40:08.240 --> 40:12.699
Now that you're awake, you're kicking me out?

375
40:14.040 --> 40:16.126
That's not what I meant.

376
40:23.640 --> 40:24.786
Relax.

377
40:25.480 --> 40:26.999
I was kidding.

378
40:45.280 --> 40:48.546
Actually, you can sleep in another bedroom.

379
40:48.546 --> 40:49.800
There's a bed there.

380
40:49.800 --> 40:52.059
You'll be a little more comfortable.

381
40:52.059 --> 40:54.719
With your legs like this, how can I leave you alone?

382
40:55.519 --> 40:57.880
If you need anything tonight, call me.

383
40:57.880 --> 40:59.240
Don't hesitate.

384
41:02.240 --> 41:03.406
Get some sleep.

385
42:22.840 --> 42:27.180
For more than two years, all I wanted was for you to wake up.

386
42:28.600 --> 42:30.560
Now you're really awake,

387
42:31.659 --> 42:33.940
and I don't know how to face you.

388
43:34.480 --> 43:37.741
I heard you coughing, so have some pear syrup.

389
43:46.319 --> 43:48.000
Where's Xiao Tang?

390
43:48.000 --> 43:49.360
She didn't help you?

391
43:50.840 --> 43:55.260
My fingers felt weak, so I wanted to practice on my own.

392
44:02.000 --> 44:03.160
Let me.

393
44:03.160 --> 44:04.401
No need.

394
44:05.559 --> 44:06.693
Let go.

395
44:19.240 --> 44:20.519
Hold still.

396
44:39.760 --> 44:41.019
Hold still.

397
44:43.360 --> 44:47.960
Once your hands are stronger, I'm done waiting on you.

398
45:05.640 --> 45:06.813
There.

399
45:17.080 --> 45:20.597
The doctor said stringing beads helps exercise your fingers.

400
45:20.597 --> 45:22.320
I got them ready for you.

401
45:22.320 --> 45:23.480
Thank you.

402
45:23.480 --> 45:24.700
You're welcome.

403
45:28.360 --> 45:29.539
Try it.

404
45:54.880 --> 45:57.220
That's all right. Try again.

405
46:17.840 --> 46:19.219
No rush.

406
46:19.219 --> 46:20.519
I'll teach you.

407
47:12.000 --> 47:14.741
Lady Ping Jun, do you want to play cat's cradle?

408
47:16.320 --> 47:18.046
It'll help train your hands.

409
47:29.659 --> 47:31.480
Bring me some roses.

410
47:31.480 --> 47:33.960
But, Master Chang Xuan, the roses aren't ready--

411
47:33.960 --> 47:34.993
Go.

412
47:43.120 --> 47:44.626
What are you waiting for?

413
47:46.360 --> 47:47.613
Keep going.
